      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.4,
      "end_seconds": 274.04,
      "duration_seconds": 15.64,
      "text": "So, you can sit up now. So, based on the history and the examination, I think we're dealing with polymyalgia rheumatica at this stage. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 276.05,
      "end_seconds": 278.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Oh, will it clear up?"
