      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.17,
      "end_seconds": 301.25,
      "duration_seconds": 21.08,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with polymyalgia rheumatica do well once it's treated properly. I'll request blood tests, it'll help with proximal stiffness. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. Okay, anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 302.52,
      "end_seconds": 306.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "So, good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    }
